<Article
  seoTitle="How to record a bug report on Mac: video, steps and a link"
  description="Record a bug on your Mac so a developer can reproduce it: what to show, a marker where it breaks, the steps written out from your clicks, secrets blurred, and one link to paste in the ticket. Free."
  path={path} og="guide-bug-report"
  title="How to record a bug report on your Mac"
  lede="A short video of a bug answers the question every developer asks first: what exactly did you do? Record the steps from a known start, mark the moment it breaks, blur anything private, and paste one link into the ticket. With Reelbird the written steps come from the same recording, so you don't type them out."
  crumbs={[{ name: "Guides", path: "/guides/" }, { name: "Record a bug report", path }]}
  datePublished="2026-11-22"
